    "detailed_description": "In <strong>Bad Guys at School</strong> you can play as <strong>students</strong> and revolt against school system, or decide to <strong>become a teacher</strong> that must maintain order despite the <strong>violence and brutality</strong> in the school. Play in multiplayer or single player mode and complete missions to earn reputation and money to become a &quot;Bad Guy&quot;.<br><br>In multiplayer mode, play as teachers or students. Each team must have the highest score at the end of the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1218280/extras/76b063d1840129660e99e2903ece7df0.poster.avif?t=1593206301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1218280/extras/76b063d1840129660e99e2903ece7df0.webm?t=1593206301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1218280/extras/76b063d1840129660e99e2903ece7df0.mp4?t=1593206301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Collect items in the map or earn money and buy items in the shop. Each item allows you to complete a specific mission and enhances your progress in the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1218280/extras/a3aba0af89fa93418a5322b8a954b23b.poster.avif?t=1593206301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1218280/extras/a3aba0af89fa93418a5322b8a954b23b.webm?t=1593206301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1218280/extras/a3aba0af89fa93418a5322b8a954b23b.mp4?t=1593206301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Explore the map and interact with the elements that surround you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_im